  "description": "The man in the image is Juan Carlos I of Spain, former King of Spain, who is seen here speaking at the World Law Congress 2019 in Madrid. His presence and the context of the event are critical to understanding the meme, as it implies a formal, official perspective ('how they see') being contrasted with a personal, possibly dismissive one ('how i see').",
